  {
    "id": "b0aad9e6-2020-5460-a3ae-e4df5b563b6b",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "class-feature",
    "slug": "class-feature:divine-ally",
    "name": "Divine Ally",
    "level": 3,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["champion"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=692"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your devotion attracts a spirit of your deity's alignment. Once you choose an ally, your choice can't be changed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The following are divine allies:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blade Ally",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " A spirit of battle dwells within your armaments. Select one weapon or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "30f44d19-1eec-5808-ae18-11a7bb4d8a59",
            "label": "Handwraps of Mighty Blows (+1)"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " when you make your daily preparations. In your hands, the item gains the effect of a property rune. For a champion following the tenets of good, choose "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "disrupting",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ghost touch",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "returning",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", or "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shifting",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". You also gain the weapon's critical specialization effect."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you are a champion following the tenets of evil, you can choose the following property runes: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fearsome",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "returning",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", or "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shifting",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "af6a98d1-1629-5078-8b7f-d650d6e279af"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Shield Ally",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " A spirit of protection dwells within your shield. In your hands, the shield's Hardness increases by 2 and its HP and BT increase by half."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Steed Ally",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You gain a young animal companion as a mount. Ordinarily, your animal companion is one that has the mount special ability, such as a horse. You can select a different animal companion (GM's discretion), but this ability doesn't grant it the mount special ability."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.ERwuazupczhUSZ73"
    },
    "data": {}
  },
  {
