  },
  {
    "id": "2b2bb0e1-bb8d-5c72-930c-a2bec98c733a",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "class-feature",
    "slug": "class-feature:liberator",
    "name": "Liberator",
    "level": 1,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["champion"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Causes.aspx?ID=3"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You defend the freedom of others. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ba3a7521-4de2-50d3-8141-fb398774967d"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " champion's reaction and the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ff652482-2177-52e0-973f-1ec91c5e2f69"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " devotion spell. Your code gains the follow edicts and anathema:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Edicts",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " oppose slavery and tyranny, fight for others' freedom to make their own decisions, respect choices others make for their own lives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Anathema",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " force or threaten someone to act a certain way, engage in slavery or tyranny"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Divine SmiteLevel 9"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You punish those who ensnare your allies in bondage. If the triggering enemy was using any effects to make your ally grabbed, restrained, immobilized, or paralyzed when you used Liberating Step, that enemy takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "@attr.cha",
                "damageType": "spirit",
                "category": "persistent"
              }
            ],
            "label": "persistent spirit damage"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " equal to your Charisma modifier."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ExaltLevel 11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You can help your whole group get into position. When you use Liberating Step, if your ally doesn't attempt to break free of an effect, you and all allies within 15 feet can Step, in addition to the triggering ally."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "ba3a7521-4de2-50d3-8141-fb398774967d",
        "allowDuplicate": false,
        "predicate": [
          {
            "or": ["class:champion", "feat:champions-reaction"]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "RollOption",
        "domain": "all",
        "option": "sanctification:holy"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.FCoMFUsth4xB4veC"
    },
    "data": {
      "tags": ["champion-cause", "holy"]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "69f268ff-8094-569f-8969-f63ad61f33bf",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "class-feature",
    "slug": "class-feature:mutagenist",
    "name": "Mutagenist",
    "level": 1,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["alchemist"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/ResearchFields.aspx?ID=3"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You focus on bizarre mutagenic transformations that sacrifice one aspect of a creature's physical or psychological being in order to strengthen another. You start with the formulas for two common 1st-level alchemical mutagens, in addition to your other formulas."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your research field adds a number of formulas to your formula book; these are your signature items. When using a batch of Infused Reagents to create your signature items using "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "941d4a1c-a6b7-5123-b992-fe1d82e8bc52"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", you create three items instead of two. Each time you gain a level, you can swap one of your signature items with another formula in your formula book. This new signature item must be on your research field's list of possible signature items."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You gain the following free action."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mutagenic Flashback"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You experience a brief resurgence of a mutagen. Choose one mutagen you've consumed since your last daily preparations. You gain the effects of that mutagen for 1 minute."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "56293a49-1aa2-5884-b11c-4d69f3dff437",
            "label": "Field Discovery"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Level 5"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When using Advanced Alchemy to make mutagens during your daily preparations, you can use a batch of reagents to create any three mutagens instead of just two of the same mutagen."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Perpetual InfusionsLevel 7"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You have learned how to create perpetual alchemical infusions that can provide a near-infinite supply of certain simple items. You gain the ability to create two 1st-level alchemical items using Quick Alchemy without spending a batch of infused reagents. The items you can select depend on your research field and must be in your formula book."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each time you gain a level, you can swap any number of your perpetual infusions with other eligible infusions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Choose two 1st-level mutagens."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Perpetual PotencyLevel 11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your perpetual infusions improve, allowing you to use "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ef01dc12-d06f-5f19-a1f3-097f23cd75a9"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to create more powerful items with no cost. The items you can select depend on your research field and must be in your formula book."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Choose two 3rd-level or lower mutagens."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "f000c13f-9324-5f6d-b6fc-80370ba0db0e",
            "label": "Greater Field Discovery"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Level 13"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you imbibe another mutagen while you are under the effects of a mutagen, you can gain the benefits and the drawbacks of both mutagens at once, despite the fact that they both have the polymorph trait and would not normally function together."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you come under the effects of any further mutagens while benefiting from two mutagens, you lose the benefit of one of the former mutagens of your choice, while retaining the drawbacks of all the mutagens."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you are under the effects of two mutagens and you come under the effect of a non-mutagen polymorph effect, you lose the benefits of the mutagens while retaining the drawbacks of both."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Perpetual PerfectionLevel 17"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You have perfected your perpetual infusions, allowing you to use Quick Alchemy to create even more powerful items at no cost. The items you can select depend on your research field and must be in your formula book."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Choose two 11th-level or lower mutagens."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.tvdb1jkjl2bRZjSp"
    },
    "data": {
      "tags": ["alchemist-research-field"]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3965c104-f9ef-576a-a71e-ba716d732fa3",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "class-feature",
    "slug": "class-feature:paladin",
    "name": "Paladin",
    "level": 1,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["champion"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Causes.aspx?ID=1"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You're honorable, forthright, and committed to pushing back the forces of cruelty. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "17aa8796-8085-5e51-a96f-5bd6a9308f47"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " champion's reaction and the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ff652482-2177-52e0-973f-1ec91c5e2f69"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " devotion spell. Your code gains the follow edicts and anathema:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Edicts",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " follow the law, respect legitimate authorities or leadership"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Anathema",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " take advantage of another, cheat"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Divine SmiteLevel 9"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You surround evil targets in a punishing halo. If you hit with your Retributive Strike, the target takes persistent spirit damage equal to your Charisma modifier."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ExaltLevel 11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When you use Retributive Strike, each ally within 15 feet of you with the target in their melee reach can spend a reaction to Strike the target with a -5 penalty."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "17aa8796-8085-5e51-a96f-5bd6a9308f47",
        "allowDuplicate": false,
        "predicate": [
          {
            "or": ["class:champion", "feat:champions-reaction"]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "RollOption",
        "domain": "all",
        "option": "option:retributive-strike",
        "toggleable": true,
        "predicate": [
          {
            "or": ["class:champion", "feat:champions-reaction"]
          }
        ],
        "display": {
          "label": "Retributive Strike"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "RollOption",
        "domain": "all",
        "option": "sanctification:holy"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.peEXunfbSD8WcMFk"
    },
    "data": {
      "tags": ["champion-cause", "holy"]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "afbac968-a7bd-5829-9461-17d2acda1fb4",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "class-feature",
    "slug": "class-feature:perfected-form",
    "name": "Perfected Form",
    "level": 19,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["monk"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=437"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You have purged incompetence from your techniques. On your first Strike of your turn, if you roll lower than 10, you can treat the attack roll as a 10. This is a fortune effect."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.KmTfg7Sg5va4yU00"
    },
    "data": {}
  },
  {
    "id": "66ff0a5d-c721-56a2-896a-cc021a7e55da",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "class-feature",
    "slug": "class-feature:redeemer",
    "name": "Redeemer",
    "level": 1,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["champion"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Causes.aspx?ID=2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You're full of kindness and forgiveness. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "3871772f-71c6-5f33-9fd6-563570c82834"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " champion's reaction and the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "ff652482-2177-52e0-973f-1ec91c5e2f69"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " devotion spell. Your code gains the follow edicts and anathema:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Edicts",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " try to redeem those who commit wicked deeds, show compassion to others regardless of their authority or station"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Anathema",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " kill a sapient enemy without first offering a chance at redemption"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Divine SmiteLevel 9"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A guilty conscience assails foes who spurn your Glimpse of Redemption. A foe that responds to your Glimpse of Redemption by dealing damage takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "@attr.cha",
                "damageType": "spirit",
                "category": "persistent"
              }
            ],
            "label": "persistent spirit damage"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " equal to your Charisma modifier."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ExaltLevel 11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You protect multiple allies. You can apply the resistance granted by Glimpse of Redemption to yourself and all allies within 15 feet of you, including the triggering ally, except the resistance is reduced by 2 for all."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "3871772f-71c6-5f33-9fd6-563570c82834",
        "allowDuplicate": false,
        "predicate": [
          {
            "or": ["class:champion", "feat:champions-reaction"]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "RollOption",
        "domain": "all",
        "option": "sanctification:holy"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.UyuwFp0jQqYL2AdF"
    },
